        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "From the N25 at the Duncannon Road Roundabout, on the outskirts of Wexford Town, take the R733 towards Wellingtonbridge. Continue straight for 19km until you reach Wellingtonbridge Village. Continue straight through Wellingtonbridge Village heading towards Ramsgrange / Arthurstown, passing Wallaces Homevalue Hardware & Garden Centre on your left.  Continue for approximately 5.7km then turn right onto the L4040 towards Ballycullane. Contimue for 3.6km passing through Ballycullane Village then turn left into Somer’s Way. The property for sale is located on your left-hand side (‘For Sale’ board). Eircode: Y34 D983"
